rs.\r\n- Improved Routing\r\n- PSR-0 and composer support.\r\n- Simpler configuration and bootstrapping.\r\n- Improved configuration handling.\r\n- Improved bake.\r\n\r\nSee [the roadmap](http://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/wiki/3.0-roadmap) for more details.","creator":null,"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":2464,"state":"closed","created_at":"2013-10-11T20:56:23Z","updated_at":"2015-12-17T03:00:48Z","due_on":"2015-03-22T04:00:00Z","closed_at":"2015-03-23T01:02:41Z"},"comments":5,"created_at":"2015-03-18T12:39:02Z","updated_at":"2015-03-20T00:03:04Z","closed_at":"2015-03-20T00:03:04Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"I explain my problem, I'm French and therefore works with local. \n\nSo I use \"Type::build('datetime')->useLocaleParser();\" in my AppController to parse my dates. \nIt's works well except that all my dates are set one hour ahead. \n\nFor exemple: 18/03/2015 becomes 17/03/2015 23:00:00\n\nMy edit form is: echo $this->Form->input('created', ['type' => 'text']);\n(i use Jquery timepicker with french locale)\n\nDebug request->data = 'created' => '12/03/2015',\n\nBut save 11/03/2015 in database.\n\nYet I have set my bootstrap: date_default_timezone_set (Europe / Brussels'); \nini_set ('intl.default_locale', 'fr_BE'); \n\nAnd changed the configuration of my database with:  'timezone' => '+01:00'\n\nSomeone an idea?  \n\nThank you in advance :)\n","closed_by":{"login":"markstory","id":24086,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MDg2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24086?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory","html_url":"https://github.com/markstory","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.g